Subject: [PATCH 4/5] sr-aef: name unnamed glyphs as fontTools does

A glyph the post table leaves unnamed was called gidNNNN. Now it is .notdef if
it is glyph 0, and glyphNNNNN otherwise.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
